            "row_content": "<p><strong>Important Note:</strong> While our products are made from natural, high-quality ingredients, they can still interact with certain prescription medications.</p><p>We always recommend <strong>consulting with your healthcare provider</strong> before starting any new supplement regimen to ensure it safely aligns with your specific health needs and current medications.</p>"
