            "heading": "How and when should I take my supplements for the best absorption?",
            "row_content": "<p>It depends on the specific product, but as a general rule:</p><ul><li><strong>Fat-soluble vitamins (like D3, E, and K):</strong> Take these with a meal that contains healthy fats (like avocado, eggs, or nuts) for optimal absorption.</li><li><strong>Water-soluble vitamins (like Vitamin C and B-complex):</strong> These can be taken with a glass of water on an empty stomach or with food.</li></ul><p><em>Always check the \"Suggested Use\" section on your specific bottle for exact instructions.</em></p>"
          }
