            "row_content": "<p>We strive to make our products accessible to everyone. The majority of our product line is gluten-free, non-GMO, and free of major allergens (like soy, dairy, and nuts). We also offer a wide selection of vegan and vegetarian options. You can easily find specific allergen and dietary labels on each product page and on the back of every bottle.</p><p>What specific health niche is your supplement brand targeting (e.g., gut health, fitness, sleep, or general wellness)? I can easily tailor these answers to match your exact product line and brand voice!</p>"
